at":"2026-03-19T13:24:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/15959","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15959","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15959.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/15959.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-19T13:24:47Z"},"body":"## Changes\r\n\r\n- Require the middleware secret when resolving serverless path overrides.\r\n- Remove unused ISR secret plumbing from the Vercel serverless entrypoint.\r\n- Add regression tests to ensure untrusted override query/header values are ignored.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- New tests added\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\n- No docs update needed; this is an internal Vercel adapter bug fix.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15959/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15959/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13211","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13211/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13211/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13211/events","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/13211","id":2843502002,"node_id":"PR_kwDOFL76Q86Ks86Z","number":13211,"title":"feat(vercel): allow defining ISR exclusions with regular expressions","user":{"login":"slawekkolodziej","id":381865,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MTg2NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/381865?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej","html_url":"https://github.com/slawekkolodziej","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slawekkolodziej/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3559102393,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q87UI5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pkg:%20integration","name":"pkg: integration","color":"b4a8d1","default":false,"description":"Related to any renderer integration (scope)","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":7381799190,"node_id":"LA_kwDOFL76Q88AAAABt_1RFg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/labels/pr%20preview","name":"pr preview","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"Apply this label to a PR to generate a preview release","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/milestones/26","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/milestone/26","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/milestones/26/labels","id":12357022,"node_id":"MI_kwDOFL76Q84AvI2e","number":26,"title":"5.4.0","description":"","creator":{"login":"florian-lefebvre","id":69633530,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjMzNTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69633530?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre","html_url":"https://github.com/florian-lefebvre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":6,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-02-21T14:56:49Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T14:59:23Z","due_on":"2025-02-27T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-03T14:59:23Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-02-10T20:04:55Z","updated_at":"2025-02-26T10:30:23Z","closed_at":"2025-02-26T10:30:23Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/pulls/13211","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/13211","diff_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/13211.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/pull/13211.patch","merged_at":"2025-02-26T10:30:23Z"},"body":"## Changes\r\n\r\nThere are 2 main changes in this PR:\r\n1. It is now possible to define ISR exclusions as regular expressions.\r\n2. Routes excluded from ISR do not get `_isr` route entry in `.vercel/output/config.json`.\r\n\r\nLonger answer with my reasoning:\r\n\r\nI am using Astro at www.superside.com and our website has many different API routes. I found it quite inconvenient to add every single one of them to the `isr.exclude` list manually. I prefer to have this in my astro.config.mjs instead:\r\n```\r\nisr: {\r\n  exclude: [/^\\/api/]\r\n}\r\n```\r\nWe've been using this change via patched node module on production for quite some time without any issue. However, this complicates the process of upgrading Astro for us. Ideally I would love to see this change merged into the source code.\r\n\r\nAs for the second change: as I was working on a way to make `isr.exclude` accept regular expressions, I noticed that generated `vercel/output/config.json` file has a lot of unnecessary entries in it (our website has a many excluded api routes). This change helped me investigate Vercel build outputs.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nI adjusted existing tests to handle new use cases.\r\n\r\n## Docs\r\n\r\n<!-- Could this affect a user’s behavior? We probably need to update docs! -->\r\n<!-- If docs will be needed or you’re not sure, uncomment the next line: -->\r\n/cc @withastro/maintainers-docs for feedback!\r\n\r\nIf you accept this PR it would be necessary to mention support for regular expressions support in this section of the docs:\r\nhttps://docs.astro.build/en/guides/integrations-guide/vercel/#excluding-paths-from-caching\r\n\r\n<!-- DON'T DELETE THIS SECTION! If no docs added, explain why.-->\r\n<!-- https://github.com/withastro/docs -->\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13211/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/13211/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}